{"title": "India's GST Collections See Robust Growth in June", "summary": "The Goods and Services Tax (GST) collections in India grew 13.9% to ₹1.95 lakh crore in June, driven by strong import revenues. This growth is attributed to the maturing and resilient nature of India's tax system. The increase in refund disbursements also supported businesses.", "summary_points": ["India's GST collections saw a 13.9% increase to ₹1.95 lakh crore in June.", "The growth is driven by strong import revenues, indicating the maturing and resilient nature of India's tax system.", "Increased refund disbursements also supported businesses.", "This growth suggests that the GST system is functioning effectively.", "The robust growth in GST collections highlights the positive impact of the tax reform on the Indian economy."], "title_hi": "जीएसटी कलेक्शन में 13.9% बढ़कर ₹1.95 लाख करोड़", "summary_hi": "जीएसटी कलेक्शन में 13.9% बढ़कर ₹1.95 लाख करोड़ जीएसटी कलेक्शन", "summary_points_hi": ["जीएसटी कलेक्शन में 13.9% बढ़कर ₹1.95 लाख करोड़", "इस वृद्धि का मुख्य कारण मजबूत आयात कर राजस्व है.", "वृद्धि में वापसी की वृद्धि भी व्यवसायों को समर्थन देती है।", "यह वृद्धि सुझाव देती है कि जीएसटी प्रणाली प्रभावी ढंग से काम कर रही है।", "राजस्व में मजबूत वृद्धि जीएसटी सुधार के सकारात्मक प्रभावों पर प्रकाश डालती है।"], "framing": {"left": "Left-leaning outlets collectively emphasize the robust growth in GST collections as a testament to India's maturing tax system, highlighting its resilience and effectiveness. They also note that the increase in refund disbursements supports businesses.", "center": "Centrist coverage frames the story by focusing on the 13.9% increase in GST collections and the strong import revenues driving this growth. They also mention the positive impact of the tax reform on the Indian economy.", "right": "Right-leaning outlets focus on the government's efforts to improve the GST system, highlighting the 14% growth rate and the increase in refund disbursements. They also emphasize the importance of a strong tax system for India's economic growth."}, "framing_hi": {"left": "जीएसटी कलेक्शन में मजबूत वृद्धि एक साक्ष्य है कि भारत की कर प्रणाली मatures हो रही है, जिसकी लचीलापन और प्रभावशीलता है।", "center": "केंद्रीय कवरेज GST कलेक्शन में 13.9% वृद्धि पर ध्यान केंद्रित करता है और मजबूत आयात कर राजस्व इस वृद्धि को बढ़ावा देते हैं।", "right": "राइट-लीनिंग आउटलेट्स सरकार की प्रयासों पर जोर देते हैं जीएसटी प्रणाली में सुधार, 14% वृद्धि दर और वापसी में वृद्धि को उजागर करते हैं।"}, "topic": "Economy", "region": "India", "image_url": "https://th-i.thgim.com/public/incoming/l7dffx/article71169113.ece/alternates/LANDSCAPE_1200/iStock-2173510364%201.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "The Hindu", "owner": "The Hindu", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/business/Economy/gst-mop-up-grows-14-to-195-lakh-crore-in-june/article71169062.ece", "headline": "GST mop up grows 14% to ₹1.95 lakh crore in June"}, {"source": "The Times of India", "owner": "Times Group", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/india-business/gst-collections-jump-13-9-to-rs-1-95-lakh-crore-in-june-driven-by-strong-import-tax-revenues/articleshow/132108545.cms", "headline": "GST revenue grows 13.9% in June, collections touch Rs 1.94 lakh crore"}, {"source": "Zee News (Hindi)", "owner": "Zee News (Hindi)", "lean": "right", "language": "hi", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "GST कलेक्शन में 14% की छलांग, जून में सरकारी खजाने में ₹1.95 लाख करोड़"}, {"source": "Firstpost", "owner": "Network18", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "India's GST collections rise 13.9% to Rs 1.95 lakh crore in June, driven by robust import revenues"}, {"source": "News18 Hindi", "owner": "Network18", "lean": "right", "language": "hi", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "GST Collection: सरकार की तिजोरी हुई फुल! जून में जीएसटी कलेक्शन ने तोड़े पुराने रिकॉर्ड"}, {"source": "J